  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu, ami nahosheli nenu chidi neyi nawantu achisemwa chaheseki, neyi anyikeki amudi Kristu; hinatwesheli kuhosha nenu neyi chahoshaŋawu nawantu awuspirituku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayinwishili mayeli, hinayidiishili mbŋuku, muloŋa himwayitwesheluku; hela nihanu saŋa mwabulila kuyitwesha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa muchidi antu achisemwa chaheseki. Neyi mukachi kenu mwekala ichima nikuzuŋa, himuchidi antu achisemwa chahesekuku? himwelaŋa mwelaŋawu antuku, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimudi nakwila iwu nindi, Ami nimuntu waPawulu; mukwawu nindi, Ami nimuntu waApolosi; himuyantu achisemwa chahesekuku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apolosi diyinyi? hela Pawulu diyinyi? Wejima wetu tuyakwakukalakala kumwetiyilili, mwatukunji kililuwu kudi Mwanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami natumbili, Apolosi watukumwinini; hakwila wakulishili diyi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu, watumbaŋa hela watukumwinaŋa hiyalemaku; walema diyi Nzambi wakulishaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu, watumbaŋa niwatukumwinaŋa anekali wowamu; ilaŋa wejima wawu akatambula wufwetu wawu weseka nanyidimu yawu aweni, muntu nawufwetu windi, muntu nawufwetu windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tuyakwaku kalakala ambala aNzambi; enu mudi iha daNzambi, mudi itala daNzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nimukwawu kalawenu wakutuŋa, mwaya luwi lwaNzambi lwanyinkeluwu; ami naalili chikuku, wacheŋi hakutuŋilahu. Ilaŋa ntu ejima adi kubabala mwakutuŋilawu hachikuku ichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikuku chatupawu dehi, diyi Yesu Kristu. Kwosi muntu wukutwesha kutuŋa chacheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukutuŋila wuru hachikuku ichi, hela siliva, hela malola awuseya weneni, hela nyitondu, hela matahu, hela nswadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamwekesha nyidimu yawantu ejima. Akayimwekesha kudiifuku odu, muloŋa yakamwekana mukesi; kesi kakeni kakatompa nyidimu yawantu ejima, mwayili mudimu, mwayili mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mudimu wamuntu watuŋiliyi hachikuku ichi wakashalahu, yena wakatambula wufwetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mudimu wamuntu wakasukuma, yena hakatambula wufwetuku; hakwila yena yomweni wakahanda neyi chakuhita mukesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi muntu adidimbaku. Mwinenu wumu watoŋojokaŋa nindi nidi nama ana amakonu, ekali chisupi kulonda abalumuki kwikala mukwamaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Nzambi wamonaŋa maana amakonu nindi hiwusupi. Muloŋa nasoneki nawu, Akwamaana wayikwatilaŋa kwoku kukubabala kwawu awenawu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nicheŋi nawu, Yehova weluka yitoŋojoka yawakwamaana nindi yakuhemesha hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi bayi muntu adisamba nawantuku, muloŋa yuma yejima yenwenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niPawulu, niApolosi, niPetulu, nimpata yamunu mwishina, niwumi, ni kufwa, niyuma yamafuku anu, niyuma yamba kenza; yejimiyi yenwenu hohu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninenu mudi ambala aKristu; niKristu nawa wambala waNzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
